 ### [Diffuse Lighting Models](5343-diffuse-lighting-models.md)
-Compute surface illumination for ray-marched geometry and SDFs by evaluating the geometric relationship between surface normals and light directions, encompassing pure diffuse models, Phong and Blinn-Phong variants, and Gouraud shading. This family is distinct from specular models that highlight surface gloss or ambient models that provide uniform illumination. Choose it for primary shape and depth cues in ray-marched volume rendering [G].
